#, kde-format
msgid "Band-pass"
msgstr "Pojasni propusnik"

#: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_bandpass.xml:5
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Apply a two-pole Butterworth band-pass filter with central frequency and "
"(3dB-point) band-width. The CSG option selects a constant skirt gain (peak "
"gain = Q) instead of the default: constant 0dB peak gain. The filter roll "
"off at 6dB per octave (20dB per decade). "
msgstr "Primjenjuje dvopolni Butterworthov pojasni propusnik sa središnjom frekvencijom i širinom pojasa na točki −3 dB. Opcija CSG odabire konstantno pojačanje bočnih pojaseva (vršno pojačanje = Q) umjesto zadanog konstantnog vršnog pojačanja od 0 dB. Pad filtra iznosi 6 dB po oktavi (20 dB po dekadi). "

#: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_bandpass.xml:11
#, kde-format
msgid "Constant Skirt Gain"
msgstr "Konstantno pojačanje bočnih pojaseva"

#: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_bandreject.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "Band-Reject"
msgstr "Pojasni zaporni filtar"

#: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_bandreject.xml:5
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Apply a two-pole Butterworth band-reject filter with central frequency and "
"(3dB-point) band-width. The filter roll off at 6dB per octave (20dB per "
"decade)."
msgstr "Primjenjuje dvopolni Butterworthov pojasni zaporni filtar sa središnjom frekvencijom i širinom pojasa na točki −3 dB. Pad filtra iznosi 6 dB po oktavi (20 dB po dekadi)."

#: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_bass.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "Bass"
msgstr "Bas"

#: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_bass.xml:5
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Boost or cut the bass (lower) frequencies of the audio using a two-pole "
"shelving filter with a response similar to that of a standard hi-fi’s tone-"
"controls. This is also known as shelving equalisation (EQ)"
msgstr "Pojačava ili prigušuje niske frekvencije zvuka dvopolnim filtrom police čiji je odziv sličan tonskim kontrolama standardnog hi-fi uređaja. Poznato i kao ekvilizacija policom."

