#: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_crossfeed.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "Crossfeed"
msgstr "Unakrsno propuštanje"

#: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_crossfeed.xml:7
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Apply headphone crossfeed filter.\n"
"Crossfeed is the process of blending the left and right channels of stereo "
"audio recording. It is mainly used to reduce extreme stereo separation of "
"low frequencies.\n"
"The intent is to produce more speaker like sound to the listener."
msgstr "Primijeni filtar unakrsnog propuštanja za slušalice.\nUnakrsno propuštanje miješa lijevi i desni kanal stereo snimke. Uglavnom se koristi za smanjenje izrazitog stereo razdvajanja niskih frekvencija.\nCilj je slušatelju pružiti zvuk sličniji zvučnicima."

#: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_crossfeed.xml:13
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set strength of crossfeed.\n"
"Default is 0.2. Allowed range is from 0 to 1. This sets gain of low shelf "
"filter for side part of stereo image.\n"
"Default is -6dB. Max allowed is -30db when strength is set to 1."
msgstr "Postavi jačinu unakrsnog propuštanja.\nZadano je 0,2. Dopušteni raspon je od 0 do 1. Time se postavlja pojačanje niskog filtra police za bočni dio stereo slike.\nZadano je −6 dB. Maksimalno dopušteno je −30 dB kada je jačina postavljena na 1."

#: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_crossfeed.xml:19
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Set soundstage wideness.\n"
"Default is 0.5. Allowed range is from 0 to 1. This sets cut off frequency of "
"low shelf filter.\n"
"Default is cut off near 1550 Hz. With range set to 1 cut off frequency is "
"set to 2100 Hz. "
msgstr "Postavi širinu zvučne pozornice.\nZadano je 0,5. Dopušteni raspon je od 0 do 1. Time se postavlja granična frekvencija niskog filtra police.\nZadana granična frekvencija približno je 1550 Hz. Pri vrijednosti 1 postavlja se na 2100 Hz. "

#: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_crystalizer.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "Crystalizer"
msgstr "Kristalizator"

#: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_crystalizer.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Simple algorithm for audio noise sharpening.\n"
"This filter linearly increases differences between each audio sample."
msgstr "Jednostavan algoritam za izoštravanje zvučnog šuma.\nOvaj filtar linearno povećava razlike između zvučnih uzoraka."

#: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_crystalizer.xml:12
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Sets the intensity of effect (default: 2.0).\n"
"Must be in range between -10.0 to 0 (unchanged sound) to 10.0 (maximum "
"effect).\n"
"To inverse filtering use negative value. "
msgstr "Postavlja intenzitet efekta (zadano: 2,0).\nVrijednost mora biti u rasponu od −10,0 do 0 (nepromijenjen zvuk) ili do 10,0 (maksimalan efekt).\nZa obrnuto filtriranje koristi negativnu vrijednost. "

