msgid "None,Counter Clockwise,Clockwise"
msgstr "Ništa,Obrnuto od kazaljke na satu,U smjeru kazaljke na satu"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_kaleid0sc0pe.xml:36
#, kde-format
msgid "Reflect Edges"
msgstr "Zrcali rubove"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_kaleid0sc0pe.xml:38
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If checked, reflections that end up outside the source reflect back into it."
"<br>\n"
"        Otherwise the specified background color is used."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, zrcaljenja izvan izvora vraćaju se natrag u njega.<br>\n        U suprotnom se koristi zadana boja pozadine."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_kaleid0sc0pe.xml:41
#, kde-format
msgid "Edge Threshold"
msgstr "Prag rubova"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_kaleid0sc0pe.xml:43
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Edge threshold / 4, reflections <br>\n"
"        outside the image but within this distance clamp to the edge."
msgstr "Prag rubova / 4; zrcaljenja<br>\n        izvan slike, ali unutar ove udaljenosti, ograničavaju se na rub."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_kaleid0sc0pe.xml:46
#, kde-format
msgid "Preferred Corner"
msgstr "Poželjni kut"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_kaleid0sc0pe.xml:48
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If <em>Reflect Edges</em> is not checked, <br>\n"
"        this parameter defines the preferred corner."
msgstr "Ako <em>Zrcali rubove</em> nije odabrano, <br>\n        ovaj parametar određuje poželjni kut."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_kaleid0sc0pe.xml:49
#, kde-format
msgid "Top right,Top left,Bottom left,Bottom right"
msgstr "Gore desno,Gore lijevo,Dolje lijevo,Dolje desno"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_kaleid0sc0pe.xml:52
#, kde-format
msgid "Corner Search"
msgstr "Pretraživanje kuta"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_kaleid0sc0pe.xml:54
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If checked, search clockwise for furthest corner.<br>\n"
"        Otherwise search counter clockwise."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, traži najudaljeniji kut u smjeru kazaljke na satu.<br>\n        U suprotnom traži obrnuto od kazaljke na satu."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_kaleid0sc0pe.xml:59
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Color to use if reflection<br>\n"
"        lies outside of the source image and not reflecting back in."
msgstr "Boja koja se koristi ako zrcaljenje<br>\n        izlazi izvan izvorne slike i ne vraća se natrag."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_kaleid0sc0pe.xml:62
#, kde-format
msgid "No Alpha Background"
msgstr "Pozadina bez alfe"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_kaleid0sc0pe.xml:64
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If checked, the selected<br>\n"
"        color will be used, if reflection lies outside of the source image "
"and not reflecting back in."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, odabrana<br>\n        boja koristi se kada zrcaljenje izađe izvan izvorne slike i ne vraća se natrag."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "Key Spill Mop Up"
msgstr "Uklanjanje rasipanja ključne boje"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:5
#, kde-format
msgid "Reduces the visibility of key color spill in chroma keying"
msgstr "Smanjuje vidljivost rasipanja ključne boje pri kromatskom ključanju"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:8
#, kde-format
msgid "Key Color"
msgstr "Ključna boja"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:11
#, kde-format
msgid "Target Color"
msgstr "Ciljna boja"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:14
#, kde-format
msgid "Mask Type"
msgstr "Vrsta maske"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:15
#, kde-format
msgid "Color distance,Transparency,Edge inwards,Edge outwards"
msgstr "Udaljenost boje,Prozirnost,Rub prema unutra,Rub prema van"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:18
#, kde-format
msgid "Tolerance"
msgstr "Tolerancija"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:24
#, kde-format
msgid "Hue Gate"
msgstr "Prag nijanse"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:27
#, kde-format
msgid "Saturation Threshold"
msgstr "Prag zasićenosti"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:30
#, kde-format
msgid "Operation 1"
msgstr "Operacija 1"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:31
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:38
#, kde-format
msgid "None,De-Key,Target,Desaturate,Luma adjust"
msgstr "Ništa,Ukloni ključnu boju,Cilj,Smanji zasićenost,Prilagodi luminanciju"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:34
#, kde-format
msgid "Amount 1"
msgstr "Količina 1"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:37
#, kde-format
msgid "Operation 2"
msgstr "Operacija 2"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:41
#, kde-format
msgid "Amount 2"
msgstr "Količina 2"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:44
#, kde-format
msgid "Show Mask"
msgstr "Prikaži masku"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_keyspillm0pup.xml:47
#, kde-format
msgid "Mask to Alpha"
msgstr "Maska u alfu"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lenscorrection.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "Lens Correction (frei0r)"
msgstr "Korekcija objektiva (frei0r)"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lenscorrection.xml:5
#, kde-format
msgid "Allows compensation of lens distortion"
msgstr "Omogućuje kompenzaciju izobličenja objektiva"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lenscorrection.xml:8
#, kde-format
msgid "Horizontal Center"
msgstr "Vodoravno središte"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lenscorrection.xml:11
#, kde-format
msgid "Vertical Center"
msgstr "Okomito središte"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lenscorrection.xml:14
#, kde-format
msgid "Center Correction"
msgstr "Korekcija središta"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lenscorrection.xml:17
#, kde-format
msgid "Edges Correction"
msgstr "Korekcija rubova"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_letterb0xed.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "Letter-boxing"
msgstr "Crne trake za široki prikaz"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_letterb0xed.xml:5
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Adds black borders at the top and bottom for that widescreen cinema look"
msgstr "Dodaje crne trake na vrhu i dnu za filmski izgled širokog zaslona"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_letterb0xed.xml:8
#, kde-format
msgid "Border Width"
msgstr "Širina obruba"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_letterb0xed.xml:10
#, no-c-format, kde-format
msgid ""
"Specify the width of the border<br>\n"
"        as % of half the vertical resolution (100% means both the top and "
"bottom half of the frame are black, i.e. there is no room for the picture)"
msgstr "Odredi širinu obruba<br>\n        kao postotak polovice okomite razlučivosti (100 % znači da su gornja i donja polovica kadra crne, odnosno da nema mjesta za sliku)"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_letterb0xed.xml:13
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_timeout.xml:14
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_transparency.xml:8
#: data/effects/vignette.xml:23
#, kde-format
msgid "Transparency"
msgstr "Prozirnost"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:5
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Levels Effect Name"
msgid "Levels"
msgstr "Razine"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:6
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:37
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:68
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:107
#, kde-format
msgid "Adjust levels"
msgstr "Prilagodi razine"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:13
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:44
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:82
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:121
#, kde-format
msgid "Input black level"
msgstr "Ulazna razina crne"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:16
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:47
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:87
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:126
#, kde-format
msgid "Input white level"
msgstr "Ulazna razina bijele"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:22
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:53
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:97
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:136
#, kde-format
msgid "Black output"
msgstr "Izlazna crna"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:25
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:56
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:101
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:140
#, kde-format
msgid "White output"
msgstr "Izlazna bijela"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:28
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:59
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:75
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:114
#, kde-format
msgid "Show histogram"
msgstr "Prikaži histogram"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:31
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:62
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:78
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:117
#, kde-format
msgid "Histogram position"
msgstr "Položaj histograma"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:84
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:123
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Moves the black point to the right: all pixels with that value or less will "
"be black.<br>\n"
"                This makes the dark areas even darker, influences the mid-"
"tones a little and the highlights not at all. Increases contrast."
msgstr "Pomakni crnu točku udesno: svi pikseli te ili niže vrijednosti postat će crni.<br>\n                Time se tamna područja dodatno zatamnjuju, srednji tonovi malo mijenjaju, a svijetla područja ostaju nepromijenjena. Povećava kontrast."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:89
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:128
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Moves the white point to the left: all pixels with that value or higher will "
"be white.<br>\n"
"                This makes bright areas even brighter, influences the mid-"
"tones a little and the dark areas not at all. Increases contrast."
msgstr "Pomakni bijelu točku ulijevo: svi pikseli te ili više vrijednosti postat će bijeli.<br>\n                Time se svijetla područja dodatno posvjetljuju, srednji tonovi malo mijenjaju, a tamna područja ostaju nepromijenjena. Povećava kontrast."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:94
#, no-c-format, kde-format
msgid ""
"Changes the overall brightness of the image.<br>\n"
"                Affects only the mid-tones, black and white are not "
"influenced. Default is 25%, equivalent to Gamma 1.0). Lower values (moving "
"the bar to the left) make the image darker, higher values (moving the bar to "
"the right) make it brighter."
msgstr "Mijenja ukupnu svjetlinu slike.<br>                Utječe samo na srednje tonove, ne na crnu i bijelu. Zadano je 25 %, što odgovara gammi 1,0. Niže vrijednosti (pomicanje ulijevo) zatamnjuju sliku, a više vrijednosti (pomicanje udesno) posvjetljuju je."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:98
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:137
#, kde-format
msgid "Opposite of Input black level"
msgstr "Suprotno od ulazne razine crne"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:102
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:141
#, kde-format
msgid "Opposite of Input white level"
msgstr "Suprotno od ulazne razine bijele"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_levels.xml:133
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Changes the overall brightness of the image.<br>\n"
"                Affects only the mid-tones, black and white are not "
"influenced. Default is 1. Lower values (moving the bar to the left) make the "
"image darker, higher values (moving the bar to the right) make it brighter."
msgstr "Mijenja ukupnu svjetlinu slike.<br>                Utječe samo na srednje tonove, ne na crnu i bijelu. Zadano je 1. Niže vrijednosti (pomicanje ulijevo) zatamnjuju sliku, a više vrijednosti (pomicanje udesno) posvjetljuju je."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:5
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:77
#, kde-format
msgid "Light Graffiti"
msgstr "Svjetlosni grafiti"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:8
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Light Graffiti effect.\n"
"        This effect allows one to do Light Painting (i.e. painting with "
"light sources on a photo by keeping the shutter\n"
"        opened for a while), but for video."
msgstr "Efekt svjetlosnih grafita.\n        Omogućuje svjetlosno slikanje (crtanje izvorima svjetla na fotografiji dugim otvaranjem zatvarača), ali na videozapisu."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:11
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:83
#, kde-format
msgid "Brightness Threshold"
msgstr "Prag svjetline"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:13
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:85
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"How bright (<code>R+G+B</code>) does a pixel need to be in order to be "
"recognized as a light source?<br/>\n"
"            Increasing this threshold requires brighter light sources (i.e. "
"more white or less color, respectively) but prevents some «false alarms» "
"where semi-bright parts, e.g. hands where colors can change quite a lot "
"compared to the background, are incorrectly recognized as light source."
msgstr "Koliko svijetao (<code>R+G+B</code>) treba biti piksel da bi bio prepoznat kao izvor svjetla?<br/>\n Povećanje ovog praga zahtijeva svjetlije izvore svjetla (tj. više bijele ili manje boje), ali sprječava neke «lažne alarme» gdje polusvijetli dijelovi, npr. ruke kod kojih se boje mogu prilično mijenjati u usporedbi s pozadinom, pogrešno su prepoznate kao izvor svjetla."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:16
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:88
#, kde-format
msgid "Difference Threshold"
msgstr "Prag razlike"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:18
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:90
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"How much does the strongest color channel of a pixel have to change, "
"compared to the background image (<code>max(dR, dG, dB)</code>), in order to "
"be recognized as light source? <br/>\n"
"            Increasing this threshold makes it harder for light sources to "
"be accepted on bright backgrounds, but decreases the danger of noise or "
"generally bright spots counting as light source."
msgstr "Koliko se najjači kanal boje piksela mora promijeniti u usporedbi s pozadinskom slikom (<code>max(dR, dG, dB)</code>) da bi bio prepoznat kao izvor svjetla? <br/>\n Povećanje ovog praga otežava prihvaćanje izvora svjetlosti na svijetlim pozadinama, ali smanjuje opasnost od buke ili općenito svijetlih točaka koje se računaju kao izvor svjetlosti."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:21
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:93
#, kde-format
msgid "Difference Sum Threshold"
msgstr "Prag zbroja razlika"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:23
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:95
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"How much does the sum of all color channels <em>relative to the background "
"image</em> (<code>dR + dG + dB</code>) have to change until a pixel is "
"recognized as a light source?<br/>\n"
"            Raising this value might, in some cases, avoid that some light "
"objects lit by the light source are added to the light mask."
msgstr "Koliko se zbroj svih kanala boja <em>u odnosu na pozadinsku sliku</em> (<code>dR + dG + dB</code>) mora promijeniti dok se piksel ne prepozna kao izvor svjetla?<br/>\n Povećanjem ove vrijednosti u nekim bi se slučajevima moglo izbjeći dodavanje svjetlosnih objekata osvijetljenih izvorom svjetla svjetlosnoj maski."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:26
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:98
#, kde-format
msgid "Sensitivity"
msgstr "Osjetljivost"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:28
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:100
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Light sensitivity.<br/>\n"
"            For slowly moving light source try to use a lower sensitivity to "
"obtain a better exposure."
msgstr "Osjetljivost na svjetlo.<br/>\n            Za sporo kretanje izvora svjetla pokušaj smanjiti osjetljivost radi bolje ekspozicije."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:31
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:103
#, kde-format
msgid "Lower Overexposure"
msgstr "Smanji preeksponiranost"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:33
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:105
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Lowers overexposure.<br/>\n"
"            The light mask does not get white immediately when the light "
"source is moving slowly or staying steady."
msgstr "Smanjuje preeksponiranost.<br/>\n            Maska svjetla ne postaje odmah bijela kada se izvor svjetla sporo pomiče ili miruje."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:36
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:108
#, kde-format
msgid "Dimming"
msgstr "zatamnjenje"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:37
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:109
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Dims the light mask. Lights will leave a fainting trail if it is set to a "
"value > 0."
msgstr "Zatamnjuje masku svjetla. Ako je vrijednost veća od 0, svjetla ostavljaju blijedi trag."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:40
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:112
#, kde-format
msgid "Background Weight"
msgstr "Težina pozadine"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:41
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:113
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Strength of the (calculated) background image. Setting it to 100 paints the "
"light mask directly over the background, without the painting person in the "
"image if the video starts with a «clean» background image. (See the α "
"parameter.)"
msgstr "Jačina (izračunate) pozadinske slike. Vrijednost 100 prikazuje masku svjetla izravno na pozadini, bez osobe koja slika, ako videozapis počinje „čistom” pozadinom. (Pogledajte parametar α.)"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:44
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:116
#, kde-format
msgid "α"
msgstr "α"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:46
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:118
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Determines how the effect tries to adapt to background changes. <br/>\n"
"            The Light Graffiti effect remembers the first frame of the clip "
"it is applied to, so the clip should <em>always</em> start with the painter "
"outside of the video. If the background constantly changes, e.g. on a "
"street, try to set α > 0 to calculate an average background image."
msgstr "Određuje kako se učinak pokušava prilagoditi promjenama pozadine. <br/>\n Efekt svjetlosnog grafita pamti prvi okvir isječka na koji je primijenjen, tako da bi isječak <em>uvijek</em> trebao započeti sa slikarom izvan videa. Ako se pozadina stalno mijenja, npr. na ulici pokušajte postaviti α > 0 da izračunate prosječnu pozadinsku sliku."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:50
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:122
#, kde-format
msgid "Increases the saturation of lights."
msgstr "Povećava zasićenost svjetala."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:53
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:125
#, kde-format
msgid "Show brightness statistics"
msgstr "Prikaži statistiku svjetline"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:55
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:127
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The stats switches allow easy and accurate adjustment of the threshold "
"parameters.<br/>\n"
"            Example: To adjust the brightness threshold, check this box and "
"adjust the threshold until the whole light source is highlighted. Repeat the "
"same with the other parameters. Only parts that are highlighted in <em>all</"
"em> thresholds will count as light source."
msgstr "Prekidači statistike omogućuju jednostavnu i točnu prilagodbu parametara praga.<br/>\n Primjer: Za podešavanje praga svjetline označite ovaj okvir i podešavajte prag dok se ne označi cijeli izvor svjetla. Ponovite isto s ostalim parametrima. Samo dijelovi koji su istaknuti u <em>svim</em> pragovima računat će se kao izvor svjetla."

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:58
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:130
#, kde-format
msgid "Show background difference statistics"
msgstr "Prikaži statistiku razlike pozadine"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:61
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:133
#, kde-format
msgid "Show background difference sum statistics"
msgstr "Prikaži statistiku zbroja razlika pozadine"

#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:65
#: data/effects/frei0r/frei0r_lightgraffiti.xml:137
#, kde-format
msgid ""
