"   Supports conventional mono and stereo delays, ping-pong delays and the "
"Haas effect (also known as Cross Delay Stereo)."
msgstr "TAP Stereo Echo (LADSPA 2143)<br>\n Podržava konvencionalne mono i stereo odgode, ping-pong odgode i Haas efekt (također poznat kao Cross Delay Stereo)."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2143.xml:9
#, kde-format
msgid "Cross Mode"
msgstr "Unakrsni način"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2143.xml:12
#, kde-format
msgid "Haas Effect"
msgstr "Haasov efekt"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2143.xml:15
#, kde-format
msgid "Swap Outputs"
msgstr "Zamijeni izlaze"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2143.xml:18
#, kde-format
msgid "L Delay"
msgstr "L kašnjenje"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2143.xml:21
#, kde-format
msgid "L Feedback"
msgstr "Povratna veza L"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2143.xml:24
#, kde-format
msgid "R/Haas Delay"
msgstr "Odgoda R/Haas"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2143.xml:27
#, kde-format
msgid "R/Haas Feedback"
msgstr "Povratna veza R/Haas"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2143.xml:30
#, kde-format
msgid "L Echo Level"
msgstr "Razina jeke L"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2143.xml:33
#, kde-format
msgid "R Echo Level"
msgstr "Razina jeke R"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2144.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP Tremolo"
msgstr "TAP tremolo"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2144.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP Tremolo (LADSPA 2144)<br>\n"
"   Sounds good mainly on acoustic or electric guitar tracks."
msgstr "TAP tremolo (LADSPA 2144)<br>\n   Najbolje zvuči na stazama akustične ili električne gitare."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2145.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP Scaling Limiter"
msgstr "TAP ograničivač skaliranja"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2145.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP Scaling Limiter (LADSPA 2145)<br>\n"
"   Achieves signal level limiting without audible artifacts."
msgstr "TAP ograničivač skaliranja (LADSPA 2145)<br>\n   Ograničava razinu signala bez čujnih artefakata."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2145.xml:9
#, kde-format
msgid "Limit Level"
msgstr "Ograničena razina"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2145.xml:12
#, kde-format
msgid "Output Volume"
msgstr "Izlazna glasnoća"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2146.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP AutoPanner"
msgstr "TAP automatsko panoramiranje"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2146.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP AutoPanner (LADSPA 2146)<br>\n"
"   Main use is to liven up synth tracks in the mix"
msgstr "TAP automatsko panoramiranje (LADSPA 2146)<br>\n   Uglavnom se koristi za oživljavanje sintesajzerskih staza u miksu"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2146.xml:14
#, no-c-format, kde-format
msgid ""
"Sets the wideness of panning.<br>\n"
"      A setting of 100% means that mono input signal is panned between the "
"extreme left and right positions"
msgstr "Postavlja širinu pomicanja.<br>\n Postavka od 100% znači da se mono ulazni signal pomera između krajnje lijeve i desne pozicije"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2147.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP DeEsser"
msgstr "TAP uklanjanje sibilanata"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2147.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP DeEsser (LADSPA 2147)<br>\n"
"   Used for attenuating higher pitched frequencies in vocals such as those "
"found in 'ess', 'shh' and 'chh' sounds."
msgstr "TAP DeEsser (LADSPA 2147)<br>\n Koristi se za prigušivanje viših frekvencija u vokali poput onih koji se nalaze u glasovima 'ess', 'shh' i 'chh'."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2147.xml:9
#, kde-format
msgid "Threshold Level"
msgstr "Razina praga"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2147.xml:15
#, kde-format
msgid "Sidechain Filter"
msgstr "Filtar bočnog lanca"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2147.xml:17
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The chosen filter's frequency<br>\n"
"      is set by the <b>Frequency</b> parameter"
msgstr "Frekvencija odabranog filtra<br>\n      postavlja se parametrom <b>Frekvencija</b>"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2147.xml:18
#, kde-format
msgid "Highpass,Bandpass"
msgstr "Visokopropusni,Pojasni propusni"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2147.xml:21
#, kde-format
msgid "Monitor On"
msgstr "Uključi nadzor"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2148.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP Vibrato"
msgstr "TAP vibrato"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2148.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP Vibrato (LADSPA 2148)<br>\n"
"   Modulates the pitch of its input signal with a low-frequency sinusoidal "
"signal. It is useful for guitar and synth tracks, and it can also come handy "
"if a strange effect is needed."
msgstr "TAP Vibrato (LADSPA 2148)<br>\n Modulira visinu svog ulaznog signala s niskofrekventnim sinusoidnim signalom. Koristan je za gitarske i sintisajzerske zapise, a također može dobro doći ako je potreban neobičan efekt."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2148.xml:10
#, kde-format
msgid "Determines how fast the pitch is modulated up-down"
msgstr "Određuje brzinu modulacije visine tona gore-dolje"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2148.xml:14
#, kde-format
msgid "Sets the amount of pitch modulation"
msgstr "Postavlja količinu modulacije visine tona"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2149.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP Rotary Speaker"
msgstr "TAP rotacijski zvučnik"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2149.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP Rotary Speaker (LADSPA 2149)<br>\n"
"   Simulates the sound of rotating speakers."
msgstr "TAP rotacijski zvučnik (LADSPA 2149)<br>\n   Simulira zvuk rotirajućih zvučnika."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2149.xml:9
#, kde-format
msgid "Rotor Frequency"
msgstr "Frekvencija rotora"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2149.xml:12
#, kde-format
msgid "Horn Frequency"
msgstr "Frekvencija zvučne trube"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2149.xml:15
#, kde-format
msgid "Mic Distance"
msgstr "Udaljenost mikrofona"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2149.xml:18
#, kde-format
msgid "Rotor/Horn Mix"
msgstr "Omjer rotora/zvučne trube"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2150.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP Pitch Shifter"
msgstr "TAP pomak visine tona"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2150.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP Pitch Shifter (LADSPA 2150)<br>\n"
"   Change the pitch in the range of plus/minus one octave."
msgstr "TAP pomak visine tona (LADSPA 2150)<br>\n   Promijeni visinu tona u rasponu od plus/minus jedne oktave."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2150.xml:9
#, kde-format
msgid "Semitone Shift"
msgstr "Pomak u polutonovima"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2150.xml:11
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Does the same thing as <b>Rate Shift</b></br>\n"
"      but allows to set musically sensible pitch shift rates."
msgstr "Radi istu stvar kao <b>Rate Shift</b></br>\n, ali omogućuje postavljanje glazbeno osjetljivih stopa pomaka visine."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2150.xml:14
#, kde-format
msgid "Rate Shift"
msgstr "Pomak brzine"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2150.xml:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Does the same thing as <b>Semitone Shift</b><br>\n"
"      but in percentage of the original pitch, so that is closer to a "
"\"physical\", non-musical approach"
msgstr "Radi istu stvar kao <b>Semitone Shift</b><br>\n, ali u postotku izvorne visine, tako da je bliže \"fizičkom\", ne-glazbenom pristupu"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2151.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP Equalizer/BW"
msgstr "TAP ekvilizator/širina pojasa"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2151.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP Equalizer (LADSPA (2151)<br>\n"
"    8-band equalizer with adjustable band center frequencies and bandwidth."
msgstr "TAP Equalizer (LADSPA (2151)<br>\n 8-pojasni ekvilajzer s podesivim središnjim frekvencijama pojasa i propusnošću."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2151.xml:15
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2151.xml:24
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2151.xml:33
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2151.xml:42
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2151.xml:51
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2151.xml:60
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2151.xml:69
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2151.xml:78
#, kde-format
msgid "BW"
msgstr "BW"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2151.xml:30
#, kde-format
msgid "<Gain"
msgstr "<Pojačanje"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2152.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP Dynamics (M)"
msgstr "TAP dinamika (mono)"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2152.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP Dynamics Mono (LADSPA 2152)<br>\n"
"   Allows changing the dynamic content of the audio stream"
msgstr "TAP dinamika mono (LADSPA 2152)<br>\n   Omogućuje promjenu dinamike zvučnog signala"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2152.xml:15
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2153.xml:15
#, kde-format
msgid "Offset Gain"
msgstr "Pojačanje pomaka"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2152.xml:18
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2153.xml:18
#, kde-format
msgid "Makeup Gain"
msgstr "Kompenzacijsko pojačanje"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2152.xml:21
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2153.xml:27
#, kde-format
msgid "Dynamics Transfer Function"
msgstr "Prijenosna funkcija dinamike"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2152.xml:22
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2153.xml:28
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"2:1 comp at -6dB,2:1 comp at -9dB,2:1 comp at -12dB,2:1 comp at -18dB,2.5 "
"comp at -18dB,3:1 comp at -12dB,3:1 comp at -15dB,Compressor/Gate,Expander,"
"Hard limiter at -6dB;Hard limiter at -12dB;Hard gate at -35dB;Soft limiter;"
"Soft knee comp/gate;Softgate below -36dB"
msgstr "2:1 kompenzacija na -6dB, 2:1 kompenzacija na -9dB, 2:1 kompenzacija na -12dB, 2:1 kompenzacija na -18dB, 2.5 kompenzacija na -18dB, 3:1 kompenzacija na -12dB, 3:1 kompenzacija na -15dB, kompresor/vrata, ekspander, tvrdi limiter na -6dB;Hard limiter na -12dB;Hard gate na -35dB;Meki limiter;Soft knee comp/gate;Softgate ispod -36dB"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2153.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP Dynamics (St)"
msgstr "TAP dinamika (stereo)"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2153.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP Dynamics Stereo (LADSPA 2153)<br>\n"
"   Allows changing the dynamic content of the audio stream"
msgstr "TAP dinamika stereo (LADSPA 2153)<br>\n   Omogućuje promjenu dinamike zvučnog signala"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2153.xml:23
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Controls how the envelope levels<br>\n"
"      are used to determine the needed gain adjustment"
msgstr "Upravlja načinom na koji se razine ovojnice<br>\n      koriste za određivanje potrebne prilagodbe pojačanja"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2153.xml:24
#, kde-format
msgid "Independent,Average,Peak"
msgstr "Neovisno,Prosjek,Vrh"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2154.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP Reflector"
msgstr "TAP reflektor"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2154.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP Reflector (LADSPA 2154)<br>\n"
"    Creates a psychedelic reverse audio effect."
msgstr "TAP reflektor (LADSPA 2154)<br>\n    Stvara psihodelični obrnuti zvučni efekt."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2154.xml:9
#, kde-format
msgid "Fragment Length"
msgstr "Duljina fragmenta"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2154.xml:11
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"It is best to set it to<br>\n"
"      approximately match the tempo of the track, so the Fragment Length is "
"equal to the time of one measure."
msgstr "Najbolje je postaviti da<br>\n približno odgovara tempu pjesme, tako da duljina ulomka bude jednaka vremenu jednog takta."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2155.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP Pink/Fractal Noise"
msgstr "TAP ružičasti/fraktalni šum"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2155.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP Pink/Fractal Noise (LADSPA 2155)<br>\n"
"    Adds pink noise to the incoming signal using a one-dimensional random "
"fractal line generated by the Midpoint Displacement Method."
msgstr "TAP ružičasti/fraktalni šum (LADSPA 2155)<br>\n Dodaje ružičasti šum dolaznom signalu pomoću jednodimenzionalne nasumične fraktalne linije generirane metodom pomaka srednje točke."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2155.xml:9
#, kde-format
msgid "Fractal Dimension"
msgstr "Fraktalna dimenzija"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2155.xml:12
#, kde-format
msgid "Signal Level"
msgstr "Razina signala"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2155.xml:15
#, kde-format
msgid "Noise Level"
msgstr "Razina šuma"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP Fractal Doubler"
msgstr "TAP fraktalno udvostručavanje"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP Fractal Doubler (LADSPA 2156)<br>\n"
"    Suitable for doubling tracks with vocals, acoustic/electric guitars, "
"bass and just about any other instrument on them."
msgstr "TAP Fractal Doubler (LADSPA 2156)<br>\n Prikladan za udvostručavanje pjesama s vokalima, akustičnim/električnim gitarama, basom i bilo kojim drugim instrumentom na njima."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:9
#, kde-format
msgid "Time Tracking"
msgstr "Praćenje vremena"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:11
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Determines how \"rough\" and how big<br>\n"
"      these changes are. When set to 0, changes are bigger and more chaotic "
"(\"bad backup singer\"). When set to 1, changes are smaller and smoother "
"(\"better tracking of the original\")."
msgstr "Određuje koliko su \"grube\" i koliko velike<br>\n promjene. Kada se postavi na 0, promjene su veće i kaotičnije (\"loš prateći pjevač\"). Kada se postavi na 1, promjene su manje i glađe (\"bolje praćenje izvornika\")."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:14
#, kde-format
msgid "Pitch Tracking"
msgstr "Praćenje visine tona"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:23
#, kde-format
msgid "Dry Left Position"
msgstr "Položaj neobrađenog signala lijevo"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:25
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:30
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:39
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:44
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"These controls range between 0 and 1,<br>\n"
"      0 meaning hard left and 1 meaning hard right position."
msgstr "Vrijednosti ovih kontrola kreću se od 0 do 1,<br>\n      gdje 0 znači krajnje lijevo, a 1 krajnje desno."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:28
#, kde-format
msgid "Dry Right Position"
msgstr "Položaj neobrađenog signala desno"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:37
#, kde-format
msgid "Wet Left Position"
msgstr "Položaj obrađenog signala lijevo"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2156.xml:42
#, kde-format
msgid "Wet Right Position"
msgstr "Položaj obrađenog signala desno"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2157.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP Sigmoid Booster"
msgstr "TAP sigmoidalno pojačanje"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2157.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP Sigmoid Booster (LADSPA 2157)<br>\n"
"   Applies a time-invariant nonlinear amplitude transfer function to the "
"signal."
msgstr "TAP Sigmoid Booster (LADSPA 2157)<br>\n Primjenjuje vremenski nepromjenjivu nelinearnu funkciju prijenosa amplitude na signal."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2157.xml:9
#, kde-format
msgid "Pre Gain"
msgstr "Predpojačanje"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2157.xml:10
#, kde-format
msgid "Scales the input signal before the transfer function is applied to it."
msgstr "Skalira ulazni signal prije primjene prijenosne funkcije."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2157.xml:13
#, kde-format
msgid "Post Gain"
msgstr "Naknadno pojačanje"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2157.xml:14
#, kde-format
msgid "Can be used to adjust the output gain of the effect."
msgstr "Može se koristiti za prilagodbu izlaznog pojačanja efekta."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2158.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP TubeWarmth"
msgstr "TAP toplina cijevi"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2158.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP TubeWarmth (LADSPA 2158)<br>\n"
"   Adds the character of vacuum tube amplification by emulating the "
"sonically desirable nonlinear characteristics of triodes. It also supports "
"emulating analog tape saturation."
msgstr "TAP TubeWarmth (LADSPA 2158)<br>\n Dodaje karakter pojačanja vakuumske cijevi oponašanjem zvučno poželjnih nelinearnih karakteristika trioda. Također podržava emulaciju zasićenja analogne trake."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2158.xml:10
#, kde-format
msgid "Adjusts the amount of the effect"
msgstr "Prilagođava količinu efekta"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2158.xml:13
#, kde-format
msgid "Tape--Tube Blend"
msgstr "Stapanje vrpce i cijevi"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2158.xml:14
#, kde-format
msgid "Controls the color of the TubeWarmth sound"
msgstr "Upravlja karakterom zvuka efekta TubeWarmth"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2159.xml:4
#, kde-format
msgid "TAP Chorus/Flange"
msgstr "TAP chorus/flanger"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2159.xml:6
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"TAP Chorus/Flange (LADSPA 2159)<br>\n"
"    Creates traditional Chorus and Flanger effects, spiced up a bit to make "
"use of stereo processing. It sounds best on guitar and synth tracks."
msgstr "TAP Chorus/Flange (LADSPA 2159)<br>\n Stvara tradicionalne Chorus i Flanger efekte, malo začinjene za korištenje stereo obrade. Najbolje zvuči na gitarskim i sintisajzerskim pjesmama."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2159.xml:11
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Determines the LFO frequency<br>\n"
"      with which the time-varying delay is modulated. The higher the "
"frequency, the more intense the effect will be."
msgstr "Određuje LFO frekvenciju<br>\n kojom se modulira vremenski promjenjiva odgoda. Što je veća frekvencija, to će učinak biti intenzivniji."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2159.xml:14
#, kde-format
msgid "L/R Phase Shift"
msgstr "Pomak faze L/D"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2159.xml:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Controls the phase shift between the two<br>\n"
"      LFOs. The higher this setting, the stronger the \"stereo-ness\" of the "
"effect will be. When set to 0, processing of the two channels will be in-"
"phase; when set to 180 degrees, the two LFO's are is counter-phase to create "
"the widest stereo effect."
msgstr "Kontrolira fazni pomak između dva<br>\n LFO-a. Što je ova postavka viša, \"stereo\" efekt će biti jači. Kada se postavi na 0, obrada dvaju kanala bit će u fazi; kada se postavi na 180 stupnjeva, dva LFO-a su u suprotnoj fazi kako bi stvorili najširi stereo efekt."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2159.xml:21
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Adjusts the modulation depth of the delay.<br>\n"
"      Increasing it will result in stronger modulation using the same LFO "
"frequency."
msgstr "Podešava dubinu modulacije odgode.<br>\n Povećanje će rezultirati jačom modulacijom korištenjem iste LFO frekvencije."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2159.xml:26
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Determines the fixed amount of time with<br>\n"
"      which the signal is delayed after the time-varying delay has been "
"applied. The setting of this control distinguishes between the Chorus and "
"Flanger effects. Delays smaller than 10 ms can be labeled Flanger, delays "
"above 20 ms yield Chorus, and delays in the range of 10-20 ms result in a "
"blend between Chorus and Flanger."
msgstr "Određuje fiksno vrijeme sa<br>\n u kojem signal kasni nakon primjene vremenski promjenjive odgode. Postavka ove kontrole razlikuje efekte Chorus i Flanger. Odgode manje od 10 ms mogu se označiti kao Flanger, odgode iznad 20 ms daju Chorus, a odgode u rasponu od 10-20 ms rezultiraju mješavinom između Chorus i Flanger."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2159.xml:29
#, kde-format
msgid "Contour"
msgstr "Kontura"

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2159.xml:31
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The cutoff frequency of a high-pass<br>\n"
"      filter applied to the now twice-delayed signal."
msgstr "Granična frekvencija visokopropusnog<br>\n      filtra koji se primjenjuje na dvostruko odgođeni signal."

#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2159.xml:36
#: data/effects/ladspa/ladspa_2159.xml:41
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Allows for a final tuning of the sound.<br>\n"
"      The strongest effect is achieved if the two settings are about the "
"same. Decreasing one of them (preferably the Wet Level, to mitigate any "
"unwanted side effects) results in a subtler effect."
msgstr "Omogućuje konačno ugađanje zvuka.<br>\n Najjači učinak postiže se ako su dvije postavke približno iste. Smanjenje jedne od njih (po mogućnosti Wet Level, kako bi se ublažile sve neželjene nuspojave) rezultira suptilnijim učinkom."

